Lawnchair X10 is an independent local adaptation, not an official Lawnchair or
ATOTO release. ATOTO, Lawnchair, Google, Audible and Pandora names identify
compatible products and remain their respective owners' marks.

The optional launcher build uses Lawnchair 15 Beta 3 (v15.0.0-beta3.0), which
includes Android Launcher3 and third-party dependencies. This source release
contains our layout helper and build transformation, not the upstream APK or
its decoded code/assets. Upstream notices and dependency licenses remain
applicable to locally built binaries.

Upstream Lawnchair LICENSE.txt identifies The Android Open Source Project
(2005-2008) and Lawnchair (2024) under Apache License 2.0. The canonical pinned
license and release links are recorded in THIRD_PARTY.md.

Modified launcher components in the locally built APK: DeviceProfile constructor,
Hotseat.setInsets, BubbleTextView.applyIconAndLabel, package/provider/permission
identity literals, AndroidManifest.xml, resources.arsc package name, and the
added io.atoto.home.X10Dock helper. Original resource files and native libraries
are retained. Changes are for namespace isolation and dock geometry only.
